# Use cases

- Implement `UseCase<EntityType, Params>` from `i_usecase.dart`. `call` returns `TaskEither<BaseFailure, EntityType>`.
- No arguments: use `NoParams` (`equatable`, `const NoParams()`).
- Annotate `@LazySingleton()`. Inject the **interface** (`ICatalogRepository`), not the concrete repository.
- Delegate only; no GraphQL or mapping here. Exception: `SignInUseCase` has no repository — it validates email `test@user.com` and password `Test1234`, returning `TaskEither<BaseFailure, Unit>`.

```dart
@LazySingleton()
class GetCatalogItemsUseCase
    implements UseCase<List<CatalogItemEntity>, NoParams> {
  GetCatalogItemsUseCase(this.repository);
  final ICatalogRepository repository;

  @override
  TaskEither<BaseFailure, List<CatalogItemEntity>> call(NoParams params) {
    return repository.getCatalogItems();
  }
}
```

- Blocs run with `await useCase.call(const NoParams()).run()` then `result.fold(...)`.
